{
  "meta": {
    "kind": "production",
    "id": "hurufi.production.literacy.wave8",
    "title": "Literacy path — Wave 8",
    "description": "Eighth production literacy slice: letter ش on the established SHOW → PRACTICE → TEST pattern. Compact two-unit wave. Reuses fatha and established sukun inside شَمْس only. شَمْس is the single new Band A word. Final س form is prepared because Wave 7 scored only initial س. No ع, ن, خ, ه, ط, madd, kasra, damma, hamza, scored س/ش discrimination, required review, or Wave 9.",
    "notProductionCurriculum": false
  },
